OL,3,GNEWSASwimmer completes challenge to
OL,4,Across 10 lakes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn open-water swimmer has completed a
OL,7,Fchallenge to swim Switzerland's 10
OL,8,Flargest lakes.
OL,10,FNeil Gilson, from Ilfracombe, Devon,
OL,11,Fsaid he finished the challenge when he
OL,12,Fswam across Lake Geneva in just over 22
OL,13,Fhours, finishing on Wednesday morning.
OL,15,FHe said: "It's a long swim,10 hours of
OL,16,Fdarkness and lots of pain."
OL,18,FHe said after finishing he felt "a
OL,19,Flittle bit broken, lots of little
OL,20,Fniggles and sore bits, but really
OL,21,Fpleased that I've managed to get it
OL,22,Fdone".
